{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And they wearied themselves to find the door.</b> Even though they were struck <b>with blindness</b>, they toiled to find the doorway <b>to break down the door</b>, as the Sages said (Eiruvin 19a): רְשָׁעִים אֲפִלּוּ עוֹמְדִים בְּפִתְחוֹ שֶׁל גֵּיהִנֹּם אֵינָם חוֹזְרִים בִּתְשׁוּבָה — \"The wicked, even standing at the entrance of Gehinnom, do not turn back in repentance.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:47.853809281Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}